# A turn cut short with Escape at the pane; only Escape moves it on.
#
# The working screen has no mode footer, so the footer appearing means the key
# arrived. How a footer affects the idle rule is tested in tests/e2e_reader.rs.
hook SessionStart {"source": "startup"}
hook UserPromptSubmit {"prompt": "port the importer"}
print I'll port the importer.
await Escape
# The turn ends where it stood and claude is back at its prompt. No Stop hook
# fires for an interrupted turn.
print ❯
print   Opus 5 (1M context) │ ◈ 2% │ mock-claude (amx/port-importer-c3d) │ ◖ xhigh
print   ⏵⏵ auto mode on (shift+tab to cycle) · ← for agents
sleep 600000
